{"id":"db96cabedd089e5f","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-binary-program-coding.md","title":"Effective Binary Coding of Machines and Pairs","display":"df-effective-machine-encoding — Effective Binary Coding of Machines and Pairs","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-binary-program-coding","aliases":["73-df-binary-program-coding","73-df-effective-machine-encoding"],"display":"df-effective-machine-encoding — Effective Binary Coding of Machines and Pairs","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","[[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","[[73-df-encoding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-binary-program-coding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-binary-program-coding</span><span>73-df-effective-machine-encoding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-effective-machine-encoding — Effective Binary Coding of Machines and Pairs"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a63442026b2f1a9a\" href=\"?note=a63442026b2f1a9a\" title=\"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm\">73-df-eight-tuple-dtm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"888d8ab66ec7efca\" href=\"?note=888d8ab66ec7efca\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-semantics\">73-df-dtm-language-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" href=\"?note=004d4e2ba3fdd14e\" title=\"73-df-dtm-language-decision\">73-df-dtm-language-decision</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2c2693f4159269f6\" href=\"?note=2c2693f4159269f6\" title=\"73-df-encoding\">73-df-encoding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 为候选机器，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*\">\\(x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{WordCoding}\">\\(\\operatorname{WordCoding}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lex}\">\\(\\mathrm{lex}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}\">\\(\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2c2693f4159269f6\" href=\"?note=2c2693f4159269f6\" title=\"73-df-encoding\">73-df-encoding</a>；规范转移表按状态、带字符的数值字典序排列。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是候选六元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}\">\\(\\operatorname{MachineCoding}\\)</span> 的右侧对其全部分量存在量化。使用编码记号时，固定满足该谓词的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E=(\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{decode},\\operatorname{esc},\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{unpair})\">\\(\\mathcal E=(\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{decode},\\operatorname{esc},\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{unpair})\\)</span>，各名称指该固定元组的相应分量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 是方向编码函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_j\">\\(\\pi_j\\)</span> 是从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"1\">\\(1\\)</span> 开始编号的有限元组投影。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{esc}\">\\(\\operatorname{esc}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pair}\">\\(\\operatorname{pair}\\)</span> 是下述固定函数；包分量必须等于这些函数，而不是任意注入。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{blank}\">\\(\\mathrm{blank}\\)</span> 是机器八元组中的空白字符分量，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a63442026b2f1a9a\" href=\"?note=a63442026b2f1a9a\" title=\"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm\">73-df-eight-tuple-dtm</a>；表格子句的机器见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 取自 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\)</span>，其八个分量由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1,\\ldots,\\pi_8\">\\(\\pi_1,\\ldots,\\pi_8\\)</span> 读取。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>在最后的重命名子句中，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=(Q_S,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma_S,b_S,\\delta_S,s_0,s_{\\mathsf{acc}},s_{\\mathsf{rej}})\">\\(S=(Q_S,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma_S,b_S,\\delta_S,s_0,s_{\\mathsf{acc}},s_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M=(Q_M,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma_M,b_M,\\delta_M,m_0,m_{\\mathsf{acc}},m_{\\mathsf{rej}})\">\\(M=(Q_M,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma_M,b_M,\\delta_M,m_0,m_{\\mathsf{acc}},m_{\\mathsf{rej}})\\)</span> 属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\">\\(\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\gamma\">\\(\\alpha,\\gamma\\)</span> 为候选函数图。这与结构、表格谓词中的候选 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是各子句独立的参数声明。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}\">\\(\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}\\)</span> 同时约束状态、带字符、初态、两种终态和每条转移；不以单独的语言相等代替运行保持。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CanonDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}\\;\\exists Q,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\n\\Bigl[M=(Q,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CanonDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}\\;\\exists Q,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\n\\Bigl[M=(Q,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}:\\operatorname{CanonDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\},\\qquad\n\\iota\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf L,0),(\\mathsf R,1)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}:\\operatorname{CanonDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\},\\qquad\n\\iota\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf L,0),(\\mathsf R,1)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\exists r,g\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}\\;\\exists S\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\exists e:\\{1,\\ldots,(r-2)g\\}\\to\n\\{\\langle q,a\\rangle:q\\in\\pi_1(S)\\setminus\\{\\pi_7(S),\\pi_8(S)\\}\\land a\\in\\pi_3(S)\\}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\nM=S\\land\\pi_1(S)=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\pi_3(S)=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\\\\\n{}\\land\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}\n(\\{\\langle q,a\\rangle:q\\in\\pi_1(S)\\setminus\\{\\pi_7(S),\\pi_8(S)\\}\\land a\\in\\pi_3(S)\\},e)\\\\\n{}\\land\\tau=\\langle r,g,\\pi_4(S),\\pi_6(S),\\pi_7(S),\\pi_8(S)\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=1}^{(r-2)g}\n\\Bigl\\langle\n\\pi_1\\bigl((\\pi_5(S))(\\pi_1(e(i)),\\pi_2(e(i)))\\bigr),\n\\pi_2\\bigl((\\pi_5(S))(\\pi_1(e(i)),\\pi_2(e(i)))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\qquad\\iota\\bigl(\\pi_3\\bigl((\\pi_5(S))(\\pi_1(e(i)),\\pi_2(e(i)))\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\rangle\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\exists r,g\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}\\;\\exists S\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\exists e:\\{1,\\ldots,(r-2)g\\}\\to\n\\{\\langle q,a\\rangle:q\\in\\pi_1(S)\\setminus\\{\\pi_7(S),\\pi_8(S)\\}\\land a\\in\\pi_3(S)\\}\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\nM=S\\land\\pi_1(S)=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\pi_3(S)=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\\\\\n{}\\land\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}\n(\\{\\langle q,a\\rangle:q\\in\\pi_1(S)\\setminus\\{\\pi_7(S),\\pi_8(S)\\}\\land a\\in\\pi_3(S)\\},e)\\\\\n{}\\land\\tau=\\langle r,g,\\pi_4(S),\\pi_6(S),\\pi_7(S),\\pi_8(S)\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=1}^{(r-2)g}\n\\Bigl\\langle\n\\pi_1\\bigl((\\pi_5(S))(\\pi_1(e(i)),\\pi_2(e(i)))\\bigr),\n\\pi_2\\bigl((\\pi_5(S))(\\pi_1(e(i)),\\pi_2(e(i)))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\qquad\\iota\\bigl(\\pi_3\\bigl((\\pi_5(S))(\\pi_1(e(i)),\\pi_2(e(i)))\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\rangle\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{tab}\\coloneqq\n\\{(M,\\tau)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\times\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tab}:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{tab}\\coloneqq\n\\{(M,\\tau)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\times\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tab}:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{esc}:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{esc}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{esc}(x\\langle b\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{esc}(x)\\langle0,b\\rangle\n\\quad(x\\in\\mathbf2^*,\\ b\\in\\mathbf2)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{esc}:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{esc}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{esc}(x\\langle b\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{esc}(x)\\langle0,b\\rangle\n\\quad(x\\in\\mathbf2^*,\\ b\\in\\mathbf2)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{pair}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{esc}(x)\\langle1,1\\rangle y\n\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{pair}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{esc}(x)\\langle1,1\\rangle y\n\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\exists c:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\exists d:\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\to\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\n\\exists s:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\exists p:(\\mathbf2^*)^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\exists u:\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\to(\\mathbf2^*)^2\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathcal E=(e,c,d,s,p,u)\\land\\operatorname{WordCoding}(e)\\\\\n{}\\land c=e\\circ\\operatorname{tab}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\\\\n{}\\land d=\\{(z,M)\\in\\mathbf2^*\\times\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}:(M,z)\\in c\\}\n\\land d\\circ c=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}}\\\\\n{}\\land s=\\operatorname{esc}\\land p=\\operatorname{pair}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\\\\n{}\\land u=\\{(z,v)\\in\\mathbf2^*\\times(\\mathbf2^*)^2:(v,z)\\in p\\}\n\\land u\\circ p=\\operatorname{id}_{(\\mathbf2^*)^2}\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\exists c:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\exists d:\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\to\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\n\\exists s:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\exists p:(\\mathbf2^*)^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\exists u:\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\to(\\mathbf2^*)^2\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathcal E=(e,c,d,s,p,u)\\land\\operatorname{WordCoding}(e)\\\\\n{}\\land c=e\\circ\\operatorname{tab}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\\\\n{}\\land d=\\{(z,M)\\in\\mathbf2^*\\times\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}:(M,z)\\in c\\}\n\\land d\\circ c=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}}\\\\\n{}\\land s=\\operatorname{esc}\\land p=\\operatorname{pair}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\\\\n{}\\land u=\\{(z,v)\\in\\mathbf2^*\\times(\\mathbf2^*)^2:(v,z)\\in p\\}\n\\land u\\circ p=\\operatorname{id}_{(\\mathbf2^*)^2}\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall e:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{WordCoding}(e)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!\\mathcal F\\in\\{\\mathcal G:\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal G)\\}\\;\\pi_1(\\mathcal F)=e\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall e:\\mathbb N^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{WordCoding}(e)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!\\mathcal F\\in\\{\\mathcal G:\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal G)\\}\\;\\pi_1(\\mathcal F)=e\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{code}(M)\n\\quad(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}),\\qquad\n\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(x,y)\n\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{code}(M)\n\\quad(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}),\\qquad\n\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(x,y)\n\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;(L(S)=L(M))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;(L(S)=L(M))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}(S,M,\\alpha,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha_0:Q_S\\xrightarrow{\\sim}Q_M\\;\\exists\\gamma_0:\\Gamma_S\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\Gamma_M\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\alpha=\\alpha_0\\land\\gamma=\\gamma_0\n\\land\\gamma_0(0)=0\\land\\gamma_0(1)=1\\land\\gamma_0(b_S)=b_M\\\\\n{}\\land\\alpha_0(s_0)=m_0\\land\\alpha_0(s_{\\mathsf{acc}})=m_{\\mathsf{acc}}\n\\land\\alpha_0(s_{\\mathsf{rej}})=m_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\\\\n{}\\land\\bigl(\\forall q\\in Q_S\\setminus\\{s_{\\mathsf{acc}},s_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\;\n\\forall a\\in\\Gamma_S\\;\\forall(p,b,D)\\in Q_S\\times\\Gamma_S\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\;\\\\\n\\qquad\\delta_S(q,a)=(p,b,D)\\Longrightarrow\n\\delta_M(\\alpha_0(q),\\gamma_0(a))=(\\alpha_0(p),\\gamma_0(b),D)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}(S,M,\\alpha,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha_0:Q_S\\xrightarrow{\\sim}Q_M\\;\\exists\\gamma_0:\\Gamma_S\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\Gamma_M\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\alpha=\\alpha_0\\land\\gamma=\\gamma_0\n\\land\\gamma_0(0)=0\\land\\gamma_0(1)=1\\land\\gamma_0(b_S)=b_M\\\\\n{}\\land\\alpha_0(s_0)=m_0\\land\\alpha_0(s_{\\mathsf{acc}})=m_{\\mathsf{acc}}\n\\land\\alpha_0(s_{\\mathsf{rej}})=m_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\\\\n{}\\land\\bigl(\\forall q\\in Q_S\\setminus\\{s_{\\mathsf{acc}},s_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\;\n\\forall a\\in\\Gamma_S\\;\\forall(p,b,D)\\in Q_S\\times\\Gamma_S\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\;\\\\\n\\qquad\\delta_S(q,a)=(p,b,D)\\Longrightarrow\n\\delta_M(\\alpha_0(q),\\gamma_0(a))=(\\alpha_0(p),\\gamma_0(b),D)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\\exists\\alpha,\\gamma\\;\n\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}(S,M,\\alpha,\\gamma)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\\exists\\alpha,\\gamma\\;\n\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}(S,M,\\alpha,\\gamma)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}(S,M,\\alpha,\\gamma)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\bigl((\\operatorname{Accept}_S(w)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w))\n\\land(\\operatorname{Reject}_S(w)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_M(w))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}(S,M,\\alpha,\\gamma)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\bigl((\\operatorname{Accept}_S(w)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w))\n\\land(\\operatorname{Reject}_S(w)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_M(w))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>状态与带字符仍重命名为有限自然数初段，原表头、字段次序、转义和配对比特串保持不变。编码包的六个分量分别在其完整函数域上量化；没有把任意有效元组编码收窄为某个固定编码或多项式时间编码。</p>\n<p>表枚举从 1 开始；元组投影按其分量位置使用。配对反解从起点按两位对齐扫描，遇到首个对齐的 11 后取得第二分量。</p>\n<p>规范重命名保留每条转移、初态和两种终态，因此同时保留接受、拒绝与发散；仅有语言相等不足以推出这一点。</p>\n<p>表格编码的单射性及给定有效元组编码时编码包的存在唯一性已写入 Assertion；固定编码包不是额外假定存在的未解释对象。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm","status":"resolved","id":"a63442026b2f1a9a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"888d8ab66ec7efca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-dtm-language-decision","status":"resolved","id":"004d4e2ba3fdd14e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"2c2693f4159269f6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"2c2693f4159269f6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{WordCoding}$、$\\mathrm{lex}$、$\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}$ 见 [[73-df-encoding]]；规范转移表按状态、带字符的数值字典序排列。","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-eight-tuple-dtm","status":"resolved","id":"a63442026b2f1a9a","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{blank}$ 是机器八元组中的空白字符分量，见 [[73-df-eight-tuple-dtm]]；表格子句的机器见证 $S$ 取自 $\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}$，其八个分量由 $\\pi_1,\\ldots,\\pi_8$ 读取。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{WordCoding}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lex}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MachineCoding}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E=(\\operatorname{wordenc},\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{decode},\\operatorname{esc},\\operatorname{pair},\\operatorname{unpair})","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_j","display":false},{"tex":"1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{esc}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pair}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{blank}","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1,\\ldots,\\pi_8","display":false},{"tex":"S=(Q_S,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma_S,b_S,\\delta_S,s_0,s_{\\mathsf{acc}},s_{\\mathsf{rej}})","display":false},{"tex":"M=(Q_M,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma_M,b_M,\\delta_M,m_0,m_{\\mathsf{acc}},m_{\\mathsf{rej}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CanonDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists r,g\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}\\;\\exists Q,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\;\n\\Bigl[M=(Q,\\mathbf2,\\Gamma,\\mathrm{blank},\\delta,q_0,q_{\\mathsf{acc}},q_{\\mathsf{rej}})\n\\land M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\land Q=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\Gamma=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\\Bigr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\coloneqq\\{M\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}:\\operatorname{CanonDTM}_{\\mathbf2}(M)\\},\\qquad\n\\iota\\coloneqq\\{(\\mathsf L,0),(\\mathsf R,1)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&\\exists r,g\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge3}\\;\\exists S\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\\\\\n&\\exists e:\\{1,\\ldots,(r-2)g\\}\\to\n\\{\\langle q,a\\rangle:q\\in\\pi_1(S)\\setminus\\{\\pi_7(S),\\pi_8(S)\\}\\land a\\in\\pi_3(S)\\}\\;\\\\\n&\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\nM=S\\land\\pi_1(S)=\\{0,\\ldots,r-1\\}\\land\\pi_3(S)=\\{0,\\ldots,g-1\\}\\\\\n{}\\land\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}\n(\\{\\langle q,a\\rangle:q\\in\\pi_1(S)\\setminus\\{\\pi_7(S),\\pi_8(S)\\}\\land a\\in\\pi_3(S)\\},e)\\\\\n{}\\land\\tau=\\langle r,g,\\pi_4(S),\\pi_6(S),\\pi_7(S),\\pi_8(S)\\rangle\n\\mathbin{\\frown}\\mathop{\\mathbin{\\frown}}_{i=1}^{(r-2)g}\n\\Bigl\\langle\n\\pi_1\\bigl((\\pi_5(S))(\\pi_1(e(i)),\\pi_2(e(i)))\\bigr),\n\\pi_2\\bigl((\\pi_5(S))(\\pi_1(e(i)),\\pi_2(e(i)))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\qquad\\iota\\bigl(\\pi_3\\bigl((\\pi_5(S))(\\pi_1(e(i)),\\pi_2(e(i)))\\bigr)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\rangle\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{tab}\\coloneqq\n\\{(M,\\tau)\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\times\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}:\\operatorname{TableCode}(M,\\tau)\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{tab}:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{esc}:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{esc}(\\varepsilon)\\coloneqq\\varepsilon,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{esc}(x\\langle b\\rangle)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{esc}(x)\\langle0,b\\rangle\n\\quad(x\\in\\mathbf2^*,\\ b\\in\\mathbf2)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{pair}(x,y)\\coloneqq\\operatorname{esc}(x)\\langle1,1\\rangle y\n\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists e:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\exists c:\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\exists d:\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\to\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\n\\exists s:\\mathbf2^*\\to\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\exists p:(\\mathbf2^*)^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\exists u:\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\to(\\mathbf2^*)^2\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\mathcal E=(e,c,d,s,p,u)\\land\\operatorname{WordCoding}(e)\\\\\n{}\\land c=e\\circ\\operatorname{tab}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\\\\n{}\\land d=\\{(z,M)\\in\\mathbf2^*\\times\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}:(M,z)\\in c\\}\n\\land d\\circ c=\\operatorname{id}_{\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}}\\\\\n{}\\land s=\\operatorname{esc}\\land p=\\operatorname{pair}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(p)\\in\\mathsf{DEC}_{\\mathbf2}\\\\\n{}\\land u=\\{(z,v)\\in\\mathbf2^*\\times(\\mathbf2^*)^2:(v,z)\\in p\\}\n\\land u\\circ p=\\operatorname{id}_{(\\mathbf2^*)^2}\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall e:\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}\\to\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{WordCoding}(e)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists!\\mathcal F\\in\\{\\mathcal G:\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal G)\\}\\;\\pi_1(\\mathcal F)=e\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{code}(M)\n\\quad(M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}),\\qquad\n\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{pair}(x,y)\n\\quad(x,y\\in\\mathbf2^*)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;(L(S)=L(M))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}(S,M,\\alpha,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\alpha_0:Q_S\\xrightarrow{\\sim}Q_M\\;\\exists\\gamma_0:\\Gamma_S\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\Gamma_M\\;\n\\Biggl[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\alpha=\\alpha_0\\land\\gamma=\\gamma_0\n\\land\\gamma_0(0)=0\\land\\gamma_0(1)=1\\land\\gamma_0(b_S)=b_M\\\\\n{}\\land\\alpha_0(s_0)=m_0\\land\\alpha_0(s_{\\mathsf{acc}})=m_{\\mathsf{acc}}\n\\land\\alpha_0(s_{\\mathsf{rej}})=m_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\\\\n{}\\land\\bigl(\\forall q\\in Q_S\\setminus\\{s_{\\mathsf{acc}},s_{\\mathsf{rej}}\\}\\;\n\\forall a\\in\\Gamma_S\\;\\forall(p,b,D)\\in Q_S\\times\\Gamma_S\\times\\{\\mathsf L,\\mathsf R\\}\\;\\\\\n\\qquad\\delta_S(q,a)=(p,b,D)\\Longrightarrow\n\\delta_M(\\alpha_0(q),\\gamma_0(a))=(\\alpha_0(p),\\gamma_0(b),D)\\bigr)\n\\end{array}\\Biggr]","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\forall S\\in\\mathsf{DTM}_{\\mathbf2}\\;\\exists M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}\\;\\exists\\alpha,\\gamma\\;\n\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}(S,M,\\alpha,\\gamma)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}effective\\text{-}machine\\text{-}encoding}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}(S,M,\\alpha,\\gamma)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall w\\in\\mathbf2^*\\;\n\\bigl((\\operatorname{Accept}_S(w)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Accept}_M(w))\n\\land(\\operatorname{Reject}_S(w)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Reject}_M(w))\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":8274,"backlinks":[{"id":"b9e8acd6d8438a5d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ with $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$ (fixed coding package, see [[73-df-binary-program-coding]])"},{"id":"c57f7e70a2bf0e74","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ with $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$ (fixed coding package, see [[73-df-binary-program-coding]])"},{"id":"3e0e5af1ab7985ee","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ with $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$ and $\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}$ (fixed effective binary pairing code, see [[73-df-binary-program-coding]])"},{"id":"21f2d14c4c84bf99","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$；规范机器域及 $\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E}$ 见 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]]。$\\langle M\\rangle$ 的定义域为 $\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}$，其定义见下式。"},{"id":"349bd461911980d1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ with $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$ (fixed coding package, see [[73-df-binary-program-coding]])"},{"id":"ee6e992ddf35c1d4","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\langle x,y\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}$ 使用固定 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]] 的二进制配对；$V\\in\\mathrm P$ 是语言而非机器，$V(x,y)\\,\\mathrm{accepts}$ 由下式解释。"},{"id":"219767ec839d8c84","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"普通编号及其函数、集合类固定 $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$，见 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]]；只有涉及 $\\varphi_e^A$ 的子句另外固定 $\\operatorname{OracleProgramCoding}(\\mathcal E_{\\mathsf O})$，见 [[73-df-oracle-program-semantics]]。每个包在各自的全部子句中保持同一解释。"},{"id":"ab6c7ca255afa826","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{WordCoding}$、$\\mathrm{lex}$、$\\operatorname{LexEnumeration}$ 见 [[73-df-encoding]]；$\\iota$ 见 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]]。表格按 $(q,a_1,\\ldots,a_k)$ 的数值字典序排列，表头和每条转移字段的排列保留原接口。"},{"id":"8ff60c13bb604c68","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ with $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$ (fixed coding package, see [[73-df-binary-program-coding]])"},{"id":"c53aeda03b707867","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}$ (binary pairing code, see [[73-df-binary-program-coding]])"},{"id":"86e3771995bb6290","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的 $\\varphi_e$、[[73-df-binary-program-coding]] 的 $\\mathcal E$；$\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}$。"},{"id":"34061709b4acb279","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$；$M\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathsf{TM}}$，$w\\in\\mathbf2^*$，$\\langle M,w\\rangle=\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}$，见 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]]。"},{"id":"2caf5daca8cda484","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ with $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$ (fixed effective coding, see [[73-df-binary-program-coding]])"},{"id":"b1b899d5ae3caf58","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"若存在 $K_{\\mathcal E}$ 的判定器，先构造在判定器拒绝时接受、在其接受时发散的机器，再使用 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]] 的 $\\operatorname{DTMRenaming}_{\\mathbf2}$ 进行规范重命名。这个关系保持每条转移及接受、拒绝状态，因此保持停机与发散；仅凭语言相等不能完成此步。对规范机器的自身编码运行即得矛盾。"},{"id":"17b3325184317072","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal E$ with $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$ (fixed effective machine and pair coding, see [[73-df-binary-program-coding]])"},{"id":"220711a8be5be7e0","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\mathcal E$ 满足 $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$，见 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]]；本条的编码语言采用该同一包，不能在定义与结论之间换用另一个包。"},{"id":"15bb24af84739cac","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"普通编号固定 $\\mathcal E$ 满足 $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$，见 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]]；$\\varphi_e$ 与 $\\mathrm{RECURSIVE}_{\\mathbb N}$ 必须使用同一包。词语言类 $\\mathrm{RE}$ 的旧七元组接口固定 $\\sqcup\\notin\\mathbf2\\cup\\{\\varepsilon\\}$，见 [[73-df-seven-tuple-tm]]。数值与二进制表示的对应使用 [[73-df-numeric-program-interface]] 的同一 $\\beta$。"},{"id":"9cd45cc8e4df82aa","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\mathcal E$ 满足 $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$，见 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]]；本条的编码语言采用该同一包，不能在定义与结论之间换用另一个包。"},{"id":"f6a57904f836e3e9","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $\\mathcal E$ 满足 $\\operatorname{MachineCoding}(\\mathcal E)$，见 [[73-df-binary-program-coding]]；$\\mathbf2=\\{0,1\\}$，$\\langle M,w\\rangle=\\langle\\ulcorner M\\urcorner_{\\mathcal E},w\\rangle_{\\mathcal E}$。"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780","a63442026b2f1a9a","888d8ab66ec7efca","004d4e2ba3fdd14e","2c2693f4159269f6"]}